    "headline_insight": {
      "as_of": "2026-06-26T09:14:21.820040+00:00",
      "insight": "Readers engage with Plume almost exclusively when a recognizable TradFi or DeFi institution (Goldfinch, PIMCO, WisdomTree, Apollo, EtherFi) lends its name to a yield product — the RWA Academy educational content received near-zero clicks, exposing that credibility-by-association, not category education, is what converts Leviathan readers.",
